{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","星灵召唤"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Celestial Spirit Summon"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","在自己身边召唤“水瓶座的阿葵亚”协助战斗。阿葵亚继承露西的部分属性，登场时以及之后每隔一段时间立刻使用魔法制造水龙卷造成范围伤害，击飞敌人并使目标眩晕。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Lucy calls out Aquarius, a Celestial Spirit, to assist her in battle. Aquarius inherits some of Lucy's stats. Upon entering battle, Aquarius immediately starts a water swirl attack that deals AoE damage, knocks enemies into the air, and stuns them. This water swirl attack repeats at regular intervals."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在自己身边召唤“水瓶座的阿葵亚”帮助战斗。阿葵亚拥有露西120%的最大生命值，其余属性与露西相同。阿葵亚登场时立即使用魔法制造水龙卷，对以敌人最密集处为中心的半径1格范围内的所有敌人造成300% + 30% ATK的伤害，并使受影响的敌人被击飞并眩晕持续2秒，后续每10秒使用一次。阿葵亚的普通攻击造成100% + 10% ATK伤害，且攻击距离为10。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lucy calls out Aquarius, a Celestial Spirit, to assist her in battle. Aquarius has 120% of Lucy's max HP and 100% of Lucy's other stats. Upon entering battle, Aquarius conjures a water swirl that strikes the 1-tile area with the most enemies, dealing 300% + 30% ATK damage to all enemies in the area. The affected enemies are knocked into the air and stunned for 2s. The water swirl attack repeats every 10s. Aquarius' normal attack deals 100% + 10% ATK damage with a range of 10 tiles."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":97,"end":103,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":155,"end":161,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":255,"end":261,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":443,"end":449,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":93,"end":107,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":151,"end":165,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":251,"end":265,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"star