t:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","阿葵亚制造的水龙卷伤害提高至400% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage of Aquarius' water swirl to 400% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":53,"end":59,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":49,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","露西飞踢"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Lucy Kick"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对全场累计伤害最高的敌人进行远距离的飞踢，造成一定伤害并使其眩晕。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Lucy kicks the enemy who has dealt the highest cumulative damage, dealing damage and stunning them."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对全场累计伤害最高的1名敌人进行远距离的飞踢，造成240% + 20% ATK的伤害与持续2.5秒的眩晕。飞踢后露西会回到释放技能前的位置，且技能期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lucy delivers a powerful kick to the enemy who has dealt the highest cumulative damage, dealing 240% + 20% ATK damage and stunning them for 2.5s. After the kick, she returns to her original tile. Lucy remains unaffected while using this skill."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":100,"end":106,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":79,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":96,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":209,"end":219,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 260% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 280% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 300% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","星灵衣-水瓶座形态"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Star Dress: Aquarius Form"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能后变为“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”，可以使用魔法制造水龙卷造成范围伤害，击飞敌人并使目标眩晕。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Lucy's Ultimate transforms her into Aquarius. While in this form, she conjures water swirls to deal AoE damage, knock enemies into the air, and stun them."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自己在释放终极技能后变为“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”直至战斗结束。之后自己也能够使用水魔法制造水龙卷，对以敌人最密集处为中心的半径1格范围内的所有敌人造成300% + 30% ATK的伤害，并使受影响的敌人被击飞并眩晕持续2秒。“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”下自身攻击距离为10。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lucy's Ultimate transforms her into Aquarius for the rest of the battle. While in this form, she conjures water swirls that strike the 1-tile area with the most enemies, dealing 300% + 30% ATK damage to all enemies in the area. The water swirl also knocks enemies into the air and stuns them for 2s. In Aquarius form, Lucy's attack range extends to 10 tiles."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":78,"end":84,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":182,"end":188,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":74,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":178,"end":192,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至350% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases enemies' damage taken to 350% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":35,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至375% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases enemies' damage taken to 375% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":35,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至400% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases enemies' damage taken to 400% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":39,"end":45,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":35,"end":49,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases Haste during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提升12点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 12 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提升16点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 16 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提升20点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 20 during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","水流屏障"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Water Barrier"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","阿葵亚与“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”形态下的露西，能够使用“水流屏障”为最虚弱的友军添加护盾。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Aquarius, or Lucy in Aquarius form, can cast Water Barrier to grant a shield to the weakest ally."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","阿葵亚与“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”形态下的露西，能够使用“水流屏障”为最虚弱的友军添加能够抵御450% ATK伤害的护盾，持续8秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Aquarius, or Lucy in Aquarius form, can cast Water Barrier to grant a shield that blocks 450% ATK damage to the weakest ally, lasting 8s."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":45,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":89,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":112,"end":119,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值提高至500% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 500% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护盾存在期间，被护盾保护的角色额外提升50点远程防御。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the shielded ally's Ranged DEF by 50 while the shield is active."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值提高至550% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 550% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","若露西能量达到上限且阿葵亚在场，阿葵亚额外提高攻击速度。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","When Lucy reaches full Energy while Aquarius is on the battlefield, Aquarius' ATK SPD increases."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若露西能量达到上限且阿葵亚已经在场，阿葵亚额外提高80点攻击速度。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When Lucy reaches full Energy while Aquarius is on the battlefield, Aquarius' ATK SPD increases by 80."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","星之大河"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Fleuve d'étoiles"]]}